flowchart LR
  subgraph Users[User and browser layer]
    V[Recruiter / public visitor]
    A[Administrator]
    B[Browser + React app]
    V --> B
    A --> B
  end

  subgraph Edge[Frontend delivery]
    VE[Vercel HTTPS delivery<br/>React + TypeScript + Vite build]
  end

  subgraph App[Backend application]
    RE[Render web service<br/>Java 21 / Spring Boot]
    SEC[Spring Security + JWT filter]
    C[REST controllers]
    SV[Service / persistence layer]
    RE --> SEC --> C --> SV
  end

  subgraph Data[External data and integrations]
    DB[(Aiven MySQL 8.4.11<br/>portfolio_db)]
    CL[Cloudinary media]
    BR[Brevo HTTPS email API]
  end

  GH[GitHub main branch]
  UR[UptimeRobot HTTP monitor]

  B -->|HTTPS static assets| VE
  B -->|HTTPS REST / JSON| RE
  SV -->|JDBC / SQL, configured TLS| DB
  SV -->|HTTPS media upload / URL| CL
  SV -->|HTTPS contact notification| BR
  UR -->|HEAD /api/public/profile| RE
  GH -. configured deployment trigger; verify settings .-> VE
  GH -. configured deployment trigger; verify settings .-> RE

